TI  - Entropic gradient descent algorithms and wide flat minimaThis article is an updated version of: Pittorino F, Lucibello C, Feinauer C, Perugini G, Baldassi C, Demyanenko E and Zecchina R 2021 Entropic gradient descent algorithms and wide flat minima Int. Conf. on Learning Representations.
